#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:101
#: 1166b2f8dee34f36958294b003c1ba88
msgid "In the upper right of the map panel is a drop-down box, normally showing MISSION. If the FENCES option, is selected, then instead of mission/waypoint planning, fence creation is enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:103
#: af1a62db8c45432aa56a8213d81f3a72
msgid "Fences can be circular, or polygons. In Plane only polygon fences are allowed. In Copter and Rover,  circular and polygon, or both superimposed, are possible. Also, exclusion zones (normally a fence is an inclusion zone), are possible."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-flight-plan.rst:105
#: 888453cea8b14761a5471c3ea8954e67
msgid "For Plane, the right click menu item, has the GeoFence sub-menu:"
msgstr ""

