msgid "Left clicking will create a Rally Point at the cursor, and it will appear in the mission list to the right. Just like waypoints, these can be written to and read from, the autopilot, as well as being saved or loaded to/from a file using the \"Read\", \"Write\", \"Load File\", and \"Save File\" buttons."
